Subject: [PATCH v9 4/7] can: replace ARPHRD_CAN type checks with
 can_get_ml_priv()
X-Mailing-List: linux-can@vger.kernel.org
List-Id: <linux-can.vger.kernel.org>
List-Post: <mailto:linux-can@vger.kernel.org>
